---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About — Motif Movement">
  <section class="pt-10 sm:pt-14">
    <h2 class="font-[Space_Grotesk,system-ui,sans-serif] text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold">About</h2>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p>This is where your story goes — how the collective came together, what you're about, what makes Motif different. A few sentences to a couple paragraphs.</p>
      <h3 class="font-[Space_Grotesk,system-ui,sans-serif] text-2xl font-bold pt-4">The System</h3>
      <p>Tell us about the rig. Specs, build history, what it sounds like, what makes it yours. People want to know what's hitting them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
